# knixl tui: the home hub, browsing modules and a schema doc, then back out and quit.
Source tapes/_settings.tape
Source tapes/_prelude.tape

Type "knixl tui"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2.2s

Down
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s

Down@300ms 9
Sleep 2s
Screenshot poster.png
PageDown
Sleep 2.2s

Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Escape
Sleep 1.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 1.2s
